        "original_id": "e0f8f634-d2f0-577c-b786-58a96264a418",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bill Withers, Donna Weiss, Jackie DeShannon\n- Songs: \"Just the Two of Us\", \"Bette Davis Eyes\"\n- Albums: Winelight\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100\n- Awards: Grammy Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Bill Withers's edited version of \"Just the Two of Us\" from the album Winelight was a Grammy Award-winning hit.\n- Bill Withers's \"Just the Two of Us\" reached number two on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"Bette Davis Eyes,\" a song written and composed by Donna Weiss and Jackie DeShannon, spent nine weeks at number one ahead of Bill Withers's hit.",
